        ],
        [
          "Phase 3",
          "**✅ COMPLETE**",
          "Loop ownership transferred. `ConversationRuntime.execute_turn_loop()` owns the while-loop. AgentLoop delegates via `_ConversationLoopAdapter`. Middleware is real (async). Context build is async-safe (no `run_until_complete`). Tool execution is single-pass via `_perform_llm_turn()`. 73/73 tests pass."
